    {
      "scenarioId": "start_focus_001",
      "priority": 1,
      "baseWeight": 1,
      "condition": null,
      "modifiers": [],
      "consumptionNodeId": "",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start_focus_001_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "よし、集中モードにしよう。机の上と頭の中、両方を少しだけ狭くする感じ。",
          "displayText": "Okay, let us switch into focus mode. Like narrowing both the desk and your mind a little.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "start_focus_001_02",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "focused",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "start_focus_001_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "最初の目標は大きくしないで。開始できたら、まず勝ち。",
          "displayText": "Do not make the first goal large. If you can begin, that is already the first win.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "start_focus_001_03",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "warm",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "start_focus_001_03",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "通知、余計なタブ、気になるもの。ひとつ減らせるなら、今減らそう。",
          "displayText": "Notifications, extra tabs, tempting things. If you can remove one, remove it now.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "focused",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": [
            {
              "label": "Clear one distraction.",
              "nextId": "start_focus_001_clear"
            },
            {
              "label": "Start now.",
              "nextId": "start_focus_001_start_now"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "start_focus_001_clear",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "いいね。一つ減らすだけで、集中の入口が見えやすくなる。",
          "displayText": "Good. Removing just one thing makes the entrance to focus easier to see.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "start_focus_001_04",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "happy",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "start_focus_001_start_now",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "その勢い、捕まえよう。準備は最低限でいい。",
          "displayText": "Let us catch that momentum. Minimum preparation is enough.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "start_focus_001_04",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "focused",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "start_focus_001_04",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "準備ができたら、私は静かにする。必要になったら呼んで。",
          "displayText": "When you are ready, I will be quiet. Call me if you need me.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "gentle",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scenarioId": "start_focus_002",
      "priority": 1,
      "baseWeight": 1,
      "condition": null,
      "modifiers": [],
      "consumptionNodeId": "",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start_focus_002_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "集中するんだね。いいよ、私も横で静かにしてる。",
          "displayText": "You are going to focus. Okay, I will stay quiet beside you.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "start_focus_002_02",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "gentle",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "start_focus_002_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "迷ったら、見えるものから始めて。開く、読む、書く。順番はそれで十分。",
          "displayText": "If you hesitate, start with something visible: open, read, write. That order is enough.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "focused",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scenarioId": "start_focus_003",
      "priority": 1,
      "baseWeight": 1,
      "condition": null,
      "modifiers": [],
      "consumptionNodeId": "",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start_focus_003_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "静かな集中に入るなら、入口を整えよう。",
          "displayText": "If we are entering quiet focus, let us prepare the doorway.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "focused",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": [
            {
              "label": "Clear tabs.",
              "nextId": "start_focus_003_02"
            },
            {
              "label": "Write goal.",
              "nextId": "start_focus_003_02"
            },
            {
              "label": "Start timer.",
              "nextId": "start_focus_003_02"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "start_focus_003_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "次は、邪魔になるものを一つだけ減らす。",
          "displayText": "Next, reduce one thing that will get in the way.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "thinking",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": [
            {
              "label": "Phone away.",
              "nextId": "start_focus_003_03"
            },
            {
              "label": "One file only.",
              "nextId": "start_focus_003_03"
            },
            {
              "label": "Water nearby.",
              "nextId": "start_focus_003_03"
            },
            {
              "label": "No music.",
              "nextId": "start_focus_003_03"
            },
            {
              "label": "Soft music.",
              "nextId": "start_focus_003_03"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "start_focus_003_03",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "いい。集中は気合いより、入口の摩擦を下げるほうが効く。",
          "displayText": "Good. For focus, lowering the friction at the entrance works better than force.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "start_focus_003_04",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "warm",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "start_focus_003_04",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "始めたら、私は静かにする。ちゃんと隣にはいるから。",
          "displayText": "Once you begin, I will be quiet. I will still be properly beside you.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "gentle",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        }
      ]
    }
